{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "80ce9a246308ec9bd22e89c9dc6ba0c4cc0749eea09b0caad1ebb89159a788d0", "ja": "{$P$}さんっ！\n良かったぁ、見つかって～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n有找到你真是太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "df26729f9ef71209ca8f14a00f33d320ae365b3621e305c66ce52ae5f795229e", "ja": "あ、青羽さん。\nおはようございます。", "zh": "啊，青羽小姐。\n早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "149a93877ada3d565c9a2d3606c7f946c3d674834ca420d6acb52c3f8ca57096", "ja": "あの、これ、\n受け取ってください！", "zh": "不好意思，\n请你收下这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5717983567f653172a7283502b75cd5d5cd3b6b3ff7076d1470736b734afb6bf", "ja": "これって、お守り……？\n急にどうしたんですか？", "zh": "这是……护身符……？\n为什么突然给我这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "b8db9741aeaa6fce61983a0aeb59c59b944ef2f53fd8b3d190b07cb6925ea7d8", "ja": "今日、もしかしたら大変なことが\nあるかもしれませんけど……。", "zh": "今天说不定会出什么大事，\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "a4de971e64dc58c5334f3ad1cc34f4a5ca5175e42a157ea66d2df24674faa120", "ja": "{$P$}さんなら、\n絶対大丈夫ですっ！　頑張ってくださいね！", "zh": "如果是{$P$}先生一定没问题的！\n请你加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3a7b77cf963daa74b6475f249eb25b61f60b54dae33060fa7d09d6bf94a80f26", "ja": "は、はぁ。\nよくわかりませんけど、頑張ります。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n虽然不是很懂，但我会加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "537b1ca0eb2cb8aabaf72839ad075a7dda3bd7481f76d87a2ce0ee6971ee2d7c", "ja": "それと、社長さんがお呼びでしたよ？\n大切なお話だそうです！", "zh": "还有，社长在找你喔！\n他好像有重要的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2093e243be525548b0b9109fd9f14db3b96a2b6b2a52759edfd1c3e952107209", "ja": "そうですか。じゃあ、事務所に行ってきますね。\nお守り、大切にします！", "zh": "这样啊，那我到事务所一趟。\n我会爱惜这个护身符的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "0f2f11c365c211aa0e2627cd2133421ebf73fed537a6ae56669bce6c804b7119", "ja": "行ってらっしゃーい♪　足元に気をつけて\nくださいねー！　あと頭の上とかも！", "zh": "请慢走～♪走路时记得多小心喔！\n还有要注意头上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1010_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "dcc9ecd9f9e6faf17624b956a5056756c5aeaf656393f2fcc6e510e4cb04188a", "ja": "おはようございます……って、あれ？\n大量のバナナがありますけど、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "早安……呃，咦？\n怎么会有这么多香蕉呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "91a6f61959b20e46633fc54c414089e1fe25ee52c56c74b6436c6fdb3cdb1766", "ja": "安かったから、つい買いすぎちゃって……。\n{$P$}さん、よければどうぞ！", "zh": "因为很便宜，我忍不住就买太多了……\n{$P$}先生，不嫌弃的话请用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "881b2ad0b287f7144e298fb9b82964f841186dd589973dfe5098728ce308637d", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nそれじゃあ、1本いただきます。", "zh": "谢谢。\n那么，我就不客气拿一根来吃了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1014_se", "source_sha256": "d4b64aab538aeff2f4a0aa60f61da95210308844848e33905a7daad48872447f", "ja": "もぎっ……", "zh": "（剥皮……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ee6a3d48509f5b325ea830c1e2ae844b670841f7645f5c8ba64a1ee2f3b4e327", "ja": "もぐもぐ……。それで、社長。\n大切な話というのは？", "zh": "（嚼嚼）……所以社长，\n你说重要的事是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "483078befe34572006d5e3dec6fca3aec8d0008e75f13e20619bc1d6655fdf85", "ja": "もぐもぐ……。いや実は、とても面白い曲が私の元に\n届いてね。早速、デモテープを流してみるとしよう。", "zh": "（嚼嚼）……其实是有一首很有趣的歌曲送到我这里了。\n赶快来放放看试听带吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a63f3bcdf0504cbbf09f866865c7a1c3baf2206a97db3a397771270c9345c932", "ja": "なるほど、確かに面白い曲ですね！\nライブでとても盛り上がりそうです！", "zh": "原来如此，这首歌的确很有趣！\n在演唱会上表演应该会很嗨！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "da1634c8dcb632856b4a173a0a2990ae93458b608f4f9dba352ed6740f827ac3", "ja": "そうだろう！　その名も、\n『ジャングル☆パーティー』という曲だ！", "zh": "对吧！\n这首歌叫做『丛林☆派对』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6b66a32481029e058f0239db310fe63fb542f142c907496ac94380f6cc80f854", "ja": "『ジャングル☆パーティー』……！", "zh": "『丛林☆派对』……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_1020", "source_sha256": "5b66a6022cf72bff189dc1fd32efe5fdabf58d738c357ce4b3917ed044d9d9f3", "ja": "ピーン！", "zh": "（灵机一动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "67a467fdf37c7052917bf48511a9f773dbfae5b828f123c57e14059ed194933d", "ja": "ピーンと来ました！　この曲、真美と環のデュオで\n行こうと思うんですが、どうですか、社長？", "zh": "我突然有个好点子！我想让真美跟环组成双人组\n来演唱这首歌曲，社长觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "5d75c9b4093dfeb378d89dc0e064d5284f0e6966e958b7506bd5bb2989f9d29b", "ja": "ピンと来た上に、その二人を選ぶとは……。やはり、\n君にはプロデューサーとしての才能があるようだ。", "zh": "突如其来的点子还能选到她们两个……\n看来你果然很有当制作人的才华。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "94c671de8774025c6a445962de94b579f34e631b9b4c73468424344cb90c4481", "ja": "これでジャングルへの道が……。", "zh": "这样一来前往丛林的路就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "724ed1d9502d4770389f3a56706b669d4974f82d8666b14596d69b3384d07120", "ja": "社長？　どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "社长？请问怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_2004_president", "source_sha256": "32d6ba1c2470a19cb1db394948f1a5edbc23c0421380eb809b302f0b602f684e", "ja": "……いや、なんでもないよ。\nそれより、君に、もう一つ大切な話がある！", "zh": "……不，没什么事。\n先别说这个了，我还有一件重要的事要跟你说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_2005_president", "source_sha256": "ac5165e2ad57459f586625242e04fe85acec2fafebe1e3755cd7eda45220b378", "ja": "今回のお披露目公演だが、\n劇場を飛び出して、地方で行おうと思っているのだよ！", "zh": "关于这次的首次亮相公演，\n我打算走出剧场，办在其他县市！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_2006_p", "source_sha256": "bb48958245e7c219e5d2a9efc5b687d5ad7d5220c62f99975aa97ab9624b2359", "ja": "本当ですか！　きっと、地方に住むファンに、\n喜んでもらえると思います！", "zh": "真的吗！我想住在其他县市的粉丝\n一定会很高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_2007_101kot", "source_sha256": "ae806dedc63eecd567533cbd3b2c0bbba7a6a98f24cece42695e3dfb59191dc9", "ja": "私と社長も、コンサートライトを持って、\n地方公演の応援に行きますからね！", "zh": "我跟社长也会带着萤光棒，\n去声援地方公演喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_2008_p", "source_sha256": "2396fbf7c7dca6cd63fccdd8fe032c5f8ee568d606cfc09ecb7d72f6d0a6e563", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n真美と環と一緒に、必ず、成功させてみせます！", "zh": "谢谢你们。\n我跟真美还有环，一定会让公演圆满成功的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_2009_p", "source_sha256": "ac314cdac4f5683f63717e26edcec33d9c2b17d07437c45f971367771d1a6130", "ja": "（ホームである劇場を飛び出しての地方公演……。\n大変だろうが、これはチャンスでもある！）", "zh": "（离开剧场──我们的家──到外县市举行地方公演……\n应该会很辛苦，不过这也是一个机会！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_intro_2010_p", "source_sha256": "1bd02ebdc8ffbc351879c57be906c1b28698d5f2ac6df6b092202f0065601507", "ja": "（普段劇場まで見に来れないファンのためにも、\n全力で頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（为了那些平常没办法亲临剧场的粉丝，\n我们也要尽全力加油！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
